    "font": {
      "$description": "FONT STACKS. VERIFIED BY READING EACH cmap - see fonts/FONTS.md. GHEA Mariam carries Latin, Cyrillic, Armenian and U+058F. Montserrat carries Latin and Cyrillic ONLY: no Armenian, no dram sign - the brandbook's three-script claim is true of the display face and false of the text face. A family called 'Montserrat Armenian' does not exist on Google Fonts; that is a question out to the designer. Until she answers, Noto Sans Armenian is a documented STAND-IN for Armenian body text, not the specification.",
      "font-display": {
        "$value": "\"MC Dram\", \"GHEA Mariam\", \"Noto Serif Armenian\", Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif",
        "$type": "fontFamily",
        "$extensions": {
          "mc.css": "--mc-font-display",
          "mc.scope": "root"
        },
        "$description": "GHEA Mariam: 827 glyphs, three scripts. It MAPS U+058F but DRAWS A POMEGRANATE there, so \"MC Dram\" must precede it - its unicode-range is U+058F alone, so it can only ever serve that one character and GHEA Mariam keeps everything else."
      },
      "font-text": {
        "$value": "\"MC Dram\", \"Montserrat\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif",
        "$type": "fontFamily",
        "$extensions": {
          "mc.css": "--mc-font-text",
          "mc.scope": "root"
        },
        "$description": "en / ru. Montserrat genuinely has no dram sign. MC Dram is the U+058F-only slice, cut from Noto Sans Armenian - NOT from GHEA Mariam, which draws a pomegranate at that codepoint."
      },
      "font-text-hy": {
        "$value": "\"MC Dram\", \"Montserrat\", \"Noto Sans Armenian\", system-ui, sans-serif",
        "$type": "fontFamily",
        "$extensions": {
          "mc.css": "--mc-font-text-hy",
          "mc.scope": "root"
        },
        "$description": "am, applied by :lang(hy). MC Dram first so the dram sign is the same drawing in all three locales; Montserrat next so Latin and Cyrillic fragments keep the brand face; Noto Sans Armenian last, carrying the Armenian - a STAND-IN until Mariam supplies the file she calls 'Montserrat Arm'."
      },
      "font-numeric": {
        "$value": "\"MC Dram\", \"Montserrat\", system-ui, sans-serif",
        "$type": "fontFamily",
        "$extensions": {
          "mc.css": "--mc-font-numeric",
          "mc.scope": "root"
        },
        "$description": "Used with font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums wherever a number can change: the calculator, the rail, the payments table. MC Dram leads so a price never renders a pomegranate."
      }
    },
